00:44:37.000 --> 00:45:23.000
one of the, and some of the, some of the girls even cried. One of the students was telling me, I thought that Hitler gathered the Jews in these concentration camps to send them to Palestine, to have them shipped to Palestine. And they had total misconception about what is the Holocaust, what is the concentration camp, what did it mean, how life was there, so it was an open door for them. But back at home, Mohamed's colleagues at the university did not see the trip as an invaluable

